			<span class="login-platform"><i class="fab fa-discord" style="color:#5865f2"></i> Discord</span>
			<span class="login-platform"><i class="fab fa-soundcloud" style="color:#ff5500"></i> SoundCloud</span>
		</div>
	</section>

	<div class="login-dynamic-section" data-dynamic-slot="counter">
		<div class="login-dynamic-inner">[content_login_counter]</div>
	</div>

	<section class="login-section" aria-labelledby="login-features-title">
		<div class="login-container">
			<div class="login-section-heading reveal-item">
				<span class="login-eyebrow"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> Why choose us</span>
				<h2 class="login-section-title" id="login-features-title">Built Different. <em>Built For Growth.</em></h2>
				<p class="login-section-description">Everything you need to manage campaigns, automate orders and support your customers from one responsive panel.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="login-feature-grid">
				<article class="login-feature-card reveal-item"><div class="login-feature-head"><span class="login-feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i></span><h3>Fast Processing</h3></div><p>Automated order handling keeps campaigns moving without unnecessary manual queues.</p></article>
				<article class="login-feature-card reveal-item"><div class="login-feature-head"><span class="login-feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-gem"></i></span><h3>Multiple Quality Tiers</h3></div><p>Choose the service quality, speed and pricing that best fits each campaign.</p></article>
				<article class="login-feature-card reveal-item"><div class="login-feature-head"><span class="login-feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-tags"></i></span><h3>Competitive Pricing</h3></div><p>Reseller-friendly rates help agencies and panel owners maintain healthy margins.</p></article>
				<article class="login-feature-card reveal-item"><div class="login-feature-head"><span class="login-feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-user-shield"></i></span><h3>Secure &amp; Private</h3></div><p>Place orders using public links without sharing social account passwords.</p></article>
				<article class="login-feature-card reveal-item"><div class="login-feature-head"><span class="login-feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-code"></i></span><h3>API Integration</h3></div><p>Connect your own store or application and automate routine panel operations.</p></article>
				<article class="login-feature-card reveal-item"><div class="login-feature-head"><span class="login-feature-icon"><i class="fas fa-headset"></i></span><h3>Helpful Support</h3></div><p>Get assistance with services, orders and account questions whenever needed.</p></article>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<div class="login-dynamic-section alternate" data-dynamic-slot="content-2">
		<div class="login-dynamic-inner">[content_login_2]</div>
	</div>

	<section class="login-section alternate" aria-labelledby="login-steps-title">
		<div class="login-container">
			<div class="login-section-heading reveal-item">
				<span class="login-eyebrow"><i class="fas fa-route"></i> How it works</span>
				<h2 class="login-section-title" id="login-steps-title">Start In <em>Three Simple Steps</em></h2>
				<p class="login-section-description">Create an account, add balance and place your first order from the dashboard.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="login-steps">
				<article class="login-step reveal-item"><span class="login-step-number">I</span><h3>Create Your Account</h3><p>Register with your details and access the complete panel dashboard.</p></article>
				<article class="login-step reveal-item"><span class="login-step-number">II</span><h3>Add Balance</h3><p>Select an available payment method and securely fund your account.</p></article>
				<article class="login-step reveal-item"><span class="login-step-number">III</span><h3>Place An Order</h3><p>Choose a service, provide the public link and track delivery live.</p></article>
