			<div class="login-cta-card reveal-item">
				<span class="login-eyebrow"><i class="fas fa-rocket"></i> Ready to begin?</span>
				<h2>Turn Your Social Media Goals Into <em>Real Growth</em></h2>
				<p>Create your account today and manage every campaign from one fast, secure and responsive dashboard.</p>
